    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96507" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στενό-της</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στειν-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>narrowness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλήσποντον, ἐόντα στεινότητα μὲν
					ἑπτὰ σταδίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.85
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότητι, -ότατα, -ότατον</span>
			codd.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ τοῦ λιμένος ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.62
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.24
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θώρηκος -ότητες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὴν ς. τῶν χωρίων</span>,
			of Thermopylae, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				2.30
			</span></i>; of the oesophagus, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				495a20
			</span></i>: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέουσα κατὰ τὰς ς</span>.
			through the <i>narrows</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				354a6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>scantiness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαπανημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					19.7.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
